<title>MEXICO: MEXICO STOCKS END AT NEW UNOFFICIAL RECORD.</title>
<headline>MEXICO STOCKS END AT NEW UNOFFICIAL RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican shares trimmed earlier highs, but were still far ahead of previous closing records when trade ended on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts and dealers said stocks gained as the recent wave of foreign buying continued.</p>
<p>Preliminary data placed the leading IPC share index  .MXX up 27.66 points when the closing bell rang, or 0.53 percent, at a historic level of 5,210.68.</p>
<p>(( --Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
